 be restored at move-out (normal wear excepted). Landlord does not retaliate against Tenant for asserting a legal right, asking for repairs, or contacting a government agency.`),o(`26. Attorney's fees`,`If either party goes to court to enforce this lease, the winning party may recover reasonable attorney's fees and court costs.`),o(`27. General terms`,`- Joint responsibility: each Tenant is fully responsible for the whole lease, including all rent.`,`- No waiver: accepting late or partial rent does not waive any right, and a waiver counts only in writing signed by both parties.`,`- Severability: if any part is invalid, the rest stays in effect.`,`- Entire agreement: this lease and its addenda are the whole agreement. Changes count only in writing signed by both parties.`,`- Good faith: the parties will try in good faith to resolve disputes before going to court.`,`- Death: this lease does not end on the death of either party.`,`- Governing law: Louisiana.`),o(`28. Additional terms`,r(`additional_terms`));let s=[[r(`first_rent_due`),`First month's rent`,Z(n(`first_rent_amount`))],[r(`deposit_due`),`Security deposit`,Z(n(`deposit_amount`))]];if(i(`pets_allowed`))for(let[e,t]of[[`pet_fee`,`Pet fee`],[`pet_deposit`,`Pet deposit`]]){let r=Z(n(e));r!==null&&r>0&&s.push([`at signing`,t,r])}let c=s.reduce((e,[,,t])=>e+(t??0),0);return o(`Payment schedule`,...s.map(([e,t,n])=>`${t}: ${n===null?`[not filled]`:In(n)}, due ${e}.`),`Total due before move-in: ${In(c)}.`),i(`built_before_1978`)&&o(`ADDENDUM 1: Disclosure of Information on Lead-Based Paint and/or Lead-Based Paint Hazards`,`Lead Warning Statement: Housing built before 1978 may contain lead-based paint. Lead from paint, paint chips, and dust can pose health hazards if not managed properly. Lead exposure is especially harmful to young children and pregnant women. Before renting pre-1978 housing, lessors must disclose the presence of known lead-based paint and/or lead-based paint hazards in the dwelling. Lessees must a